'''Thunderblood Sword''' is a version of [[Nord Sword]] upgraded with a [[Thunderblood Essence]]. It gains extra [[slash]] and [[Lightning|lightning damage]], a 25% chance per hit to trigger [[Chain lightning]] and a 0.2% damage increase for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing.

* The primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit. No damage penalty against multiple targets.
* Its secondary attack deals 3x damage with a slightly longer reach.

An upgraded Nord Sword will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Thunderblood Sword.

